  "description": "Adolf Hitler was the dictator of Nazi Germany and the primary architect of the Holocaust. His image is central to the meme, and understanding his historical role — as a genocidal leader — is essential to interpreting the meme's intent. The meme uses his image to create a darkly ironic contrast with the 'chill' text, which relies on the viewer's knowledge of his monstrous legacy.",
